---
// src/pages/shopify-tracking-hub.astro
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import AuthorCard from '../components/AuthorCard.astro';
import TLDR from '../components/TLDR.astro';

const title = "The Ultimate Shopify Tracking Hub (CAPI, GA4, Server-Side)";
const description = "Everything you need to know about Shopify server-side tracking, Meta Conversions API (CAPI), GA4, and bypassing iOS 14.5 attribution loss in 2026.";
const canonicalUrl = "https://stackarchitect.xyz/shopify-tracking-hub/";

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "name": title,
  "description": description,
  "url": canonicalUrl
};
---

<Base
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={canonicalUrl}
  schema={schema}
>

  <main class="flex-1 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 w-full">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 mb-4 text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-widest text-[#34d377] border border-[#34d377] rounded-full uppercase bg-[#34d377]/10">
        Topic Hub: Server-Side Tracking
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-6">
        The Ultimate Shopify Tracking & CAPI Hub
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 font-mono">
        Stop relying on the browser pixel. Here is the definitive directory for setting up server-side infrastructure, bypassing ad blockers, and recovering lost attribution.
      </p>
    </div>

    <TLDR 
      title="Why Server-Side Tracking Matters in 2026"
      points={[
        "iOS updates and ad blockers block up to 30% of browser pixel events.",
        "Meta CAPI (Conversions API) pushes data directly from your server to Facebook.",
        "Accurate tracking lowers your CPA and feeds the algorithms better data."
      ]}
    />

    <article class="prose-stack mt-12 mb-16">
      <h2>The Core Fundamentals</h2>
      <p>Before diving into specific setups, you must understand why traditional browser pixels (like the standard Meta Pixel or GA4 tag) fail in modern e-commerce. Safari's ITP (Intelligent Tracking Prevention) restricts cookie lifespans, meaning return purchases are often misattributed.</p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6">
        <a href="/blog/shopify-server-side-tracking-complete-setup-guide/" class="block p-4 border border-[#222825] rounded-lg hover:border-[#34d377] transition-colors bg-[#0c0f0d]">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white m-0">Server-Side Tracking 101</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-2 mb-0">The complete foundational guide to why client-side tracking is dying.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/shopify-ios-attribution-gap-benchmark/" class="block p-4 border border-[#222825] rounded-lg hover:border-[#34d377] transition-colors bg-[#0c0f0d]">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white m-0">The iOS Attribution Gap</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-2 mb-0">Check the latest benchmarks on exactly how much data iOS is blocking.</p>
        </a>
      </div>

      <h2>Meta Conversions API (CAPI)</h2>
      <p>Meta's algorithm runs on data. If you only send browser events, you are starving your own ads. CAPI ensures 100% of your purchases reach Meta's servers.</p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-8">
        <li><a href="/blog/meta-one-click-conversions-api-shopify/">How to Setup Meta CAPI on Shopify</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog/shopify-meta-roas-dropped-2026-fix/">Why Your Shopify Meta ROAS Dropped (And How to Fix It)</a></li>
        <li><a href="/capi-shield/">CAPI Shield: The Advanced Tracking Architecture</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Google Analytics 4 & Google Ads</h2>
      <p>GA4 relies heavily on modeled data to fill in the gaps left by cookie blockers, but it requires a perfectly configured foundation to work.</p>
      
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-8">
        <li><a href="/blog/shopify-google-analytics-4-setup-free-2026/">The Ultimate GA4 Shopify Setup Guide</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog/how-to-fix-shopify-google-ads-conversion-tracking-2026/">Fixing Google Ads Conversion Tracking</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Advanced Solutions & Alternatives</h2>
      <p>Don't want to pay $300/mo for a tracking app like Triple Whale or Elevar? You don't have to.</p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-8">
        <li><a href="/triple-whale-alternative/">Triple Whale Free Alternative</a></li>
        <li><a href="/elevar-alternative/">Elevar Free Alternative</a></li>
        <li><a href="/analyzify-alternative/">Analyzify Free Alternative</a></li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <AuthorCard />
  </main>

  </Base>
